{
  "key": 39608,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_ClefairyCuterNow",
      "en_US": [
        "This shrine... It isn't natural.\r",
        "It looks just like the energy\n",
        "conduits my father's people built."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_ClefairyCryPippiih",
      "en_US": [
        "But that's impossible.\n",
        "They were disbanded years ago."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_ClefairyCryPippippiih",
      "en_US": [
        "Wait... You've been talking to\n",
        "that Cyrus guy again, haven't you?\r",
        "He's the one sending you after\n",
        "the Totems."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_PikachuCry",
      "en_US": [
        "Don't trust him. He knows too much\n",
        "about these rifts to be a scholar.\r",
        "Maybe he's the reason they're\n",
        "opening."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_PikachuDazzle",
      "en_US": [
        "Still... If the Totems are holding\n",
        "the rifts open, maybe their energy\r",
        "could be used instead of sealed.\r",
        "Forget I said that. I'll find my\n",
        "own answers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_SignCanalaveCity",
      "en_US": [
        "The flowers react whenever the\n",
        "rift pulses. Their glow forms the\r",
        "same spiral every time, just like\n",
        "the old Gardevoir ward legend.\r",
        "This is no ordinary meadow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_SignJubilifeCity",
      "en_US": [
        "EVERSPRING SANCTUARY\n",
        "West: Canalave  East: Jubilife"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00007",
      "en_US": "CLEFAIRY: Pippippiih!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The shrine's crystal is warm.\n",
        "A faint vibration answers from\r",
        "deep below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_GardevoirFountainPlaque",
      "en_US": [
        "THE GUARDIAN OF EVERSPRING\n",
        "Here stands the Hero of the Glade."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_GardevoirFountainLegend1",
      "en_US": [
        "Long ago, before the gatehouses\n",
        "stood, a spatial rift tore open\r",
        "above this coastal marsh and\n",
        "threatened to swallow the road\r",
        "between Canalave and Jubilife."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_GardevoirFountainLegend2",
      "en_US": [
        "A lone Gardevoir stepped into the\n",
        "breach and wove her aura around\r",
        "the tear, turning wild distortion\n",
        "into a spring of luminous blooms.\r",
        "Travelers carved this fountain in\n",
        "her likeness, arms raised in ward."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route218_Text_GardevoirFountainWarmth",
      "en_US": [
        "The marble waters still shimmer\n",
        "with a gentle, protective warmth."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
